Instructions
Assignment: Create a C program (text file) to accomplish the following task:
Create a C program that will output the following formatted that to the console

Hello, World!

Welcome to ENGR 2304 – Programming for Engineers at Dallas College


Place the following comment header as the first line of your code
 /* YYYYTT-CCCC-NNNN-SSSSS-PXX-LASTNAME-FIRSTNAME */ using the formatting outlined in Step 3.

Rename the submission file as follows
YYYYTT-CCCC-NNNN-SSSSS-PXX-LASTNAME-FIRSTNAME.EXT where
Replace YYYY with year (e.g. 2020)
Replace TT with (SP = Spring, FA = Fall, SU = Summer)
Replace CCCC with course prefix (e.g. ENGR)
Replace NNNN with course number (e.g. 1201)
Replace SSSSS with section number (e.g. 83001)
Replace AXX with the Program Number from the Title Above (e.g. P01, P02, etc)
